   "locked": false,
   "type": "text",
   "text": "4,500 streams x 1080p ~ 9 Gbps\nif you shipped the video.\nyou do not.\n\nwhat crosses is ~2 KB of JSON\nand one 6 s clip, only when\nsomething happened.",
